This independent project integrates ABot-Recon. src/realtime_map/backend.py
adapts the inference control flow of ABot-Recon's streaming network at commit
6e3b2e1257464a74dfceff22eb33190bd228276e. Changes include explicit per-frame
state management, yielding CPU observations, and resetting stream state rather
than accumulating dense sequence outputs. The upstream checkout is not bundled.

The upstream ABot-Recon NOTICE is retained verbatim below. Its references to
third-party notices refer to the retained upstream notice files in
licenses/ABot-Recon/. Our component and exception inventory is in the root
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

